ONE<br><span>PHOTOGRAPHY & VIDEO</span></h2></div><p class="service-desc">Get breathtaking aerial shots that give your project a unique perspective.</p><ul class="checklist"><li>Events & Festivals</li><li>Real Estate & Properties</li><li>Corporate & Commercial</li><li>Tourism & Travel</li></ul></div><a class="gold-btn" href="index.html#media-booking">EXPLORE DRONE SERVICES <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article><article class="service"><div class="visual"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516280440614-37939bbacd81?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="index-badge">04</span></div><div class="service-text"><div class="title-row"><span class="tile-icon" aria-hidden="true">▧</span><h2>BRAND & SOCIAL<br><span>CONTENT</span></h2></div><p class="service-desc">Stand out online with professional photos and videos tailored for your brand, campaigns and social media.</p><ul class="checklist"><li>Product Photography</li><li>Lifestyle & Brand Shoots</li><li>Social Media Content</li><li>Editing & Post Production</li></ul></div><a class="gold-btn" href="index.html#media-booking">GET A QUOTE <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article></div></section></main><footer class="strip"><div class="shell strip-in"><div class="script">Your Vision.<br>Our Lens.</div><div class="support"><div class="support-item"><span class="support-icon">◎</span>Professional<br>Equipment</div><div class="support-item"><span class="support-icon">▣</span>Creative<br>Direction</div><div class="support-item"><span class="support-icon">▶</span>Fast Turnaround<br>Time</div><div class="support-item"><span class="support-icon">✦</span>Made for Brands<br>&amp; Events</div></div><div class="end-brand"><b>HIT</b> KENYA<small>EVENTS | PEOPLE | BRANDS | OPPORTUNITIES</small></div></div></footer><script>
